{"channelId":"UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","row":["BOSS Farms",20000,"🐾 Welcome to the Wild Side of Rescue with Tye Friis 🐾\nWith over a decade of hands-on animal rescue experience, Tye Friis has dedicated his life to saving animals in need—from local emergencies to international missions. He’s built shelters, led life-saving operations across borders, and never turns away from a creature in distress.\n\nAs the founder of B.O.S.S. Farms, Tye is now developing a 500-acre off-grid sanctuary deep in Oregon, designed to be a self-sustaining haven for both animals and people.\n\nNow a father of two, Tye’s mission is evolving—blending homesteading, family life, and large-scale rescue into a one-of-a-kind adventure. Whether you’re here for the animals, the builds, or the raw honesty of life off-grid…\n\nSubscribe and be part of the journey—every wild, muddy, beautiful step.","care@bossfarms.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:57.022Z","channelId":"UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"153ae392ab9ba777dec09188da1fdc295e42ca0f8fe69745809f7357a6d58961","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"73240c8493d6ec93d901e69959cdad4523366b7a0a5899f5035cc5a35bcf7bff"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:57.022Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":20000,"raw":"20K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCajJfb2-6JQ6UH-zyZYsc-g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:57.022Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"care@bossfarms.com","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.bossfarms.com/pages/contact